config BOARD_SCR_FPGA
        select SOC_SCR1 if BOARD_SCR_FPGA_SCR1
        select SOC_SCR7_L2 if BOARD_SCR_FPGA_SCR7_L2
        select SOC_SCR9_L2 if BOARD_SCR_FPGA_SCR9_L2
        select SOC_SCR9_L3 if BOARD_SCR_FPGA_SCR9_L3
        help
          Syntacore FPGA is a virtual board which acts as a
          bitstream testing platform. 
          It demonstrates the Syntacore CPUs features.

